# Be Beauty Bar — project context

Next.js 14 app (port 3001), Prisma/PostgreSQL, Tailwind, Resend email, Stripe deposits, SMS.

## Key domains

- **Bookings**: customer flow `/book`, admin calendar `/admin/calendar`, statuses `pending_deposit | confirmed | cancelled`
- **Messages**: Settings → Messages tab; templates in `notificationDefaults.ts`, editor in `NotificationMessagesEditor.tsx`, storage uses zero-width tokens via `messageEditorDom.ts`
- **Waitlist**: `waitlist.ts` — notify when cancellations free a bookable slot for the waitlisted service duration; cross-service for same technician; same-day OK until slot start time passes
- **Rebook reminders**: `rebookReminder.ts`, cron, opt-out link, Bookings settings toggle
- **Time off**: per-technician `AvailabilityBlock`; calendar shows names in day detail panel only (month grid stays generic “Time off”)

## Code style

- Match existing patterns; minimal diffs
- Run `npm run test:messages` / `npm run test:waitlist` when touching those libs
- Run `npx tsc --noEmit` before finishing substantive changes
- Windows/PowerShell: use `;` not `&&` in shell commands

## Do not

- Reintroduce transparent textarea + highlight overlay for message editing (use contenteditable spans)
- Commit or push unless the user explicitly asks
